rière","en":["behind"],"answer":"derrière","lemma":"derrière","pos":"prep","lvl":0,"ipa":"/dɛ.ʁjɛʁ/","kind":"function","sense":"behind something, on the far side of it","stage":1,"contrast":["devant|prep","sous|prep"],"cue":"behind","audio":null,"native":null,"cue_audio":null,"ex":[{"fr":"Je suis derrière lui.","en":"I'm behind him.","f":"derrière"},{"fr":"Tom est derrière Marie.","en":"Tom is behind Mary.","f":"derrière"},{"fr":"Ils sont derrière nous.","en":"They're behind us.","f":"derrière"},{"fr":"Sami marchait derrière eux.","en":"Sami was walking behind them.","f":"derrière"},{"fr":"Je suis derrière Tom.","en":"I'm behind Tom.","f":"derrière"},{"fr":"Ils sont derrière toi.","en":"They are behind you.","f":"derrière"},{"fr":"Les voilà derrière vous.","en":"There they are behind you.","f":"derrière"},{"fr":"Qui est derrière le complot ?","en":"Who is behind the plot?","f":"derrière"}]},{"k":"devant|prep","fr":"devant","en":["in front of","before","ahead of"],"answer":"devant","lemma":"devant","pos":"prep","lvl":0,"ipa":"/də.vɑ̃/","kind":"function","sense":"in front of something, facing it","stage":1,"contrast":["derrière|prep","entre|prep"],"cue":"in front of","audio":null,"native":null,"cue_audio":null,"ex":[{"fr":"Il court devant moi.","en":"He is running ahead of me.","f":"devant"},{"fr":"Personne ne courait devant lui.","en":"No one ran ahead of him.","f":"devant"},{"fr":"Il est devant la porte.","en":"He is in front of the door.","f":"devant"},{"fr":"Nous pouvons parler devant Tom.","en":"We can talk in front of Tom.","f":"devant"},{"fr":"J'étais juste devant toi.","en":"I was right in front of you.","f":"devant"},{"fr":"Je suis devant l'église.","en":"I'm in front of the church.","f":"devant"},{"fr":"Nous vîmes, devant nous, un château.","en":"We saw a castle ahead of us.","f":"devant"},{"fr":"Place la chaise devant le bureau.","en":"Put the chair in front of the desk.","f":"devant"}]},{"k":"entre|prep","fr":"entre","en":["between","among"],"answer":"entr